        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/SUA22-A.1-SM21>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/SUA22-A.1-SM22>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/SUA22-A.1-SM23>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/SUA22-A.1-SM24>,
