    ipbes:Report ipbes:SUA22 ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Policy instruments and tools are most successful when they pay attention to and fit both the ecological and social contexts in which they are applied. Many policy instruments for the sustainable use of wild species have been successful in some circumstances, but have failed in others." ;
    dcterms:identifier "C" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Key elements and conditions for the sustainable use of wild species" .

